  "notes": "{予定表|よていひょう} is a compound of {予定|よてい} (plan/schedule) and {表|ひょう} (chart/table/list).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {予定表|よていひょう}を{作|つく}る: to make a schedule\n- {予定表|よていひょう}を{確認|かくにん}する: to check the schedule\n- {予定表|よていひょう}に{書|か}き{込|こ}む: to write in the schedule\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- スケジュール: schedule (loanword, more casual)\n- {時間割|じかんわり}: class timetable (school)\n- {日程表|にっていひょう}: itinerary, schedule of dates",
